OL,3,GNEWSALib Dems win 'most important'
OL,4,ASalisbury by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Liberal Democrats have retained the
OL,7,FSalisbury Milford county council seat
OL,8,Fafter a by-election described as the
OL,9,Fmost important in 40 years.
OL,11,FMac Brown was elected to Wiltshire
OL,12,FCouncil with 759 votes on Thursday,
OL,13,Fbeating Conservative candidate Laura
OL,14,FBrown, followed by Reform UK, then
OL,15,FLabour.
OL,17,FIt means Wiltshire Council will
OL,18,Fcontinue to be run the same, with the
OL,19,FLib Dems in control of a minority
OL,20,Fadministration since 2025 after no
OL,21,Fparty gained enough votes to take
OL,22,Foverall control.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
