OL,3,GNEWSALib Dems win 'most important'
OL,4,ASalisbury by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Ian Thorn, council leader,
OL,7,Fsaid: "I'm delighted that we held the
OL,8,Fseat with an increased share of the
OL,9,Fvote."
